message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "Electromagnetic Field Data Simulator: topological EM coupling from Faraday tensor computations"
abstract: >-
  A high-performance topological electromagnetic coupling simulator built
  on Faraday tensor computations. A Rust reference core computes the
  Faraday tensor, Lorentz invariants, coupling fields and a topology
  proxy; a Python generator emits reproducible JSON datasets through a
  CLI; and a React application renders the fields interactively.
